---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="使用条款 (Terms of Use) | 机场狗"
  description="机场狗（JiChangDog）使用条款说明网站内容用途、用户责任、知识产权、第三方链接、责任限制以及条款更新方式，请在使用本站前阅读。"
>
  <article class="page-shell knowledge-layout">
    <div class="article-content prose">
      <div class="document-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">法律条款</p>
        <h1>使用条款 (Terms of Use)</h1>
        <p class="lead-paragraph">访问或使用本网站即表示您同意受以下条款和条件的约束。如果您不同意这些条款的任何部分，请停止使用本站。</p>
      </div>

      <h2 id="content-usage">内容使用</h2>
      <p>本站（机场狗，JiChangDog）提供的所有评测数据、文章和指南仅供参考。我们努力确保信息的准确性和及时性，但不对任何信息的准确性提供担保。用户应自行承担基于本站信息作出的任何决策或行动的风险。</p>

      <h2 id="copyright">知识产权与版权</h2>
      <p>本网站上的所有原创内容（包括文章、图表、排版设计）的版权均归机场狗所有。未经事先书面许可，您不得以商业目的复制、转载或重新分发本站的任何内容。若需转载，请务必联系我们获取授权，并注明来源。</p>

      <h2 id="third-party-services">第三方服务</h2>
      <p>本站提供的信息涉及众多第三方网络服务商。我们与这些服务商是独立的实体。我们对第三方服务商提供的服务质量、稳定性、安全性或合法性不承担任何直接或间接责任。</p>

      <h2 id="compliance">合法合规</h2>
      <p>请确保您在使用科学上网服务时，遵守您所在国家或地区的法律法规。本站仅从技术评测的角度讨论网络代理技术，不鼓励、不支持任何非法用途。用户因违反当地法律所产生的一切后果由用户自行承担。</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="toc-sidebar">
      <div class="toc-container">
        <h3 class="toc-title">本文目录</h3>
        <ul id="toc-list" class="toc-list">
          <!-- JS will populate this -->
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .knowledge-layout {
    display: flex !important;
    flex-direction: row !important;
    gap: 40px;
    padding-top: 80px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .article-content {
    flex: 1 1 0%;
    min-width: 0;
    background: #fff;
    padding: 40px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }
  
  .document-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .document-header .eyebrow {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .document-header h1 {
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  
  .prose .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #374151;
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-top: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #eff4ff;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .prose h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #1f2937;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .prose p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .prose a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .prose ul, .prose ol {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  .prose ul li, .prose ol li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4b5563;
  }
  
  /* TOC Sidebar Styles */
  .toc-sidebar {
    width: 280px !important;
    flex-shrink: 0 !important;
    position: sticky !important;
    top: 100px !important;
  }
  .toc-container {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 24px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
  }
  .toc-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .toc-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .toc-link {
    color: var(--muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1.4;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    padding-left: 10px;
    margin-left: 2px;
  }
  .toc-link:hover, .toc-link.active {
    color: var(--blue) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-left-color: var(--blue) !important;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .knowledge-layout {
      flex-direction: column !important;
    }
    .toc-sidebar {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .article-content {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .document-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const content = document.querySelector('.article-content');
    const tocList = document.getElementById('toc-list');
    if (!content || !tocList) return;

    const headings = content.querySelectorAll('h2');
    
    headings.forEach((heading) => {
      if(!heading.id) return;
      const li = document.createElement('li');
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = '#' + heading.id;
      a.textContent = heading.textContent;
      a.className = 'toc-link';
      li.appendChild(a);
      tocList.appendChild(li);
    });

    const observerOptions = {
      root: null,
      rootMargin: '-100px 0px -60% 0px',
      threshold: 0
    };

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          const id = entry.target.getAttribute('id');
          document.querySelectorAll('.toc-link').forEach(link => {
            link.classList.remove('active');
            if (link.getAttribute('href') === '#' + id) {
              link.classList.add('active');
            }
          });
        }
      });
    }, observerOptions);

    headings.forEach(heading => observer.observe(heading));
  });
</script>
